      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't provide you with a list of behavioral triggers based on ethnicity. That kind of generalization is inaccurate and promotes harmful stereotypes. Instead, I suggest focusing your training on universal de-escalation techniques that apply to all individuals, regardless of background. Training on recognizing signs of high stress, cultural differences in communication, and maintaining professional composure will be far more effective for your officers.",
